{
  "name": "Five-output tower",
  "icon": "tfmg:steel_distillation_output",
  "category": "tfmg:distillation",
  "sortnum": 8,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(item)Five outputs$() on a 2x2 tank ten blocks high. With crude oil it makes everything the six-output tower makes except naphtha; with heavy oil it runs the five-output heavy oil recipe."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Adding or removing the top output is how you switch a tower between recipes."
